                <pb facs="0015" n="1" sameAs="frus:frus1948v05p1/pg1"/>

                <head>United States economic and military aid to Greece and Turkey</head>
                <p>[Documentation on American aid to Greece and Turkey under the Truman Doctrine is
                    printed in <ref target="frus:frus1948v04/pg_1">volume IV, pages 1</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus:frus1948v04/pg_221">221</ref>. The subject of military aid to
                    these countries as it related to their interest in possible participation in
                    Western European collective defense arrangements is treated in <ref
                        target="frus:frus1948v03/pg_1">volume III, pages 1</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus:frus1948v03/pg_351">351</ref>.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
